From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: World of Warcraft <warcraft@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:19:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] vmap4_extractor: fopen64 only with glibc

musl's fopen is 64-bit already and has no fopen64 (since 1.2.4).
---
 src/tools/vmap4_extractor/vmapexport.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/tools/vmap4_extractor/vmapexport.cpp b/src/tools/vmap4_extractor/vmapexport.cpp
index 3bd12de968..95f12418a8 100644
--- a/src/tools/vmap4_extractor/vmapexport.cpp
+++ b/src/tools/vmap4_extractor/vmapexport.cpp
@@ -256,7 +256,7 @@ bool scan_patches(char* scanmatch, std::vector<std::string>& pArchiveNames)
         {
             sprintf(path, "%s.MPQ", scanmatch);
         }
-#ifdef __linux__
+#if defined(__linux__) && defined(__GLIBC__)
         if (FILE* h = fopen64(path, "rb"))
 #else
         if (FILE* h = fopen(path, "rb"))
